[[0,1396735,0,6,0,6,"2016-11-08T01:53:24","0x4F","",[],"<p>I posted a comment and had to click twice in order for it to get entered, because when I hit submit I got an error: Website currently disabled. This is a new error that I haven't seen and it's a frightening one. Getting a lot of Playpen Improvement errors too, the full page version and the one that embeds into the comment field and eats your comment.</p>\n<p>What's going on? Why would the whole website be disabled???</p>","Website currently disabled???","","voatdev"],[1,6757484,0,1,0,1,"2016-11-08T06:31:33","PuttItOut","",[],"<p>We have a blocking issue that we are working on and it's not fun finding it.</p>\n<p>We have made a few improvements to the disabled logic so it will be less intrusive.</p>\n<p>We will find and put this bug to bed sooner rather than later. </p>"]]
